"╭─────────────────────── Monday, October 5 2026 (today) ───────────────────────╮"
"│1. ╭ Keybindings ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮   │"
"│   │ Search: type a key like x, or a word like undo                       │   │"
"│   │ ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── │   │"
"│   │   Esc / q             Leave, asking to save if anything changed (w   │   │"
"│   │                       save, q don't, n back)                         │   │"
"│   │                                                                      │   │"
"│   │ Calendar                                                             │   │"
"│   │   h j k l             Move by day and week, following the layout     │   │"
"│   │   h j k l (year)      Within the month, then on to the next one      │   │"
"│   │   H / L               Previous / next month                          │   │"
"│   │   J / K (year)        The month below / above                        │   │"
"│   │   t                   Jump to today                                  │   │"
"│   │   w / m / y           Week / month / year view                       │   │"
"│   │   a                   Add an item to the selected day                │   │"
"│   │   Enter               Open the selected day's list                   │   │"
"│   │   u / Ctrl+R          Undo / redo                                    │   │"
"│   │   ?                   Show this help                                 │   │"
"│   │   Esc / q / c         Back to the list                               │   │"
"│   │                                                                      │   │"
"│   │ Anywhere                                                             │   │"
"│   │   Ctrl+C              Quit                                           │   │"
"╰───╰─────────────────────── ↑/↓ scroll · esc close ───────────────────────╯───╯"
" HELP   type to search  ↑/↓ scroll  esc close                                   "
